    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "turn 1: simple rotation",
      "links": [],
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Around 1810, Johann von Bohnenberger\nof Tübingen University designed a \"machine\" to demonstrate\nthe laws of the earth's rotation. This was essentially the first\ngyroscope. It was first mentioned by Poisson (1813), and described in\ndetail by Bohnenberger in 1817.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/kinetics/turn/simple-rotation/bohnenberger-1813-Buzengeiger--s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "204",
      "height": "300",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/kinetics/turn/simple-rotation/bohnenberger-Smithsonian-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "169",
      "height": "300",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/kinetics/turn/simple-rotation/bohnenberger-19xx-UnitedStatesMilitaryAcademyAtWestPoint%2CNew%20York-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "189",
      "height": "300",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bohnenberger's original design, as\n\nexecuted by Johann Buzengeiger,\n\nca. 1810",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A later nineteenth-century\n\nmodel, in the collection of\n\nthe Smithsonian Institute",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "An early 20th-century model\n\n(US Military Academy at\n\nWest Point, New York)",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "References",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Johann Gottlieb Friedrich Bohnenberger:\n\"Beschreibung einer Maschine zur Erläuterung der Geseze\nder Umdrehung der Erde um ihre Axe, und der Veränderung der\nLage der letzteren.\" Tübinger Blätter\nfür Naturwissenschaften und Arzneikunde 3 (1817),\npp. 72-83.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Denis Poisson: \"Mémoire\nSur un Cas particulier du Mouvement de rotation des Corps pesans.\"\nJournal de l'École\nPolytechnique 9, 16 (1813), pp. 247-262.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "J. Wagner, H. Sorg, and A. Renz:\n\"The Machine of Bohnenberger.\" European\nJournal of Navigation 3, 4 (2005), pp. 69-77.",
      "links": []
    },
